#: scripts/big_screen.gd
msgid "Map replay"
msgstr "Main semula peta"

#: scripts/big_screen.gd
msgid "The map is zoomed out to show its full extent. Ownership and city locations update as the turns play."
msgstr "Peta dizum keluar untuk menunjukkan keseluruhannya. Pemilikan dan lokasi bandar dikemas kini semasa giliran dimainkan."

#: scripts/big_screen.gd
msgid "Start replay"
msgstr "Mula main semula"

#: scripts/big_screen.gd
msgid "Return to game"
msgstr "Kembali ke permainan"

#: scripts/big_screen.gd
msgid "Turn %d of %d"
msgstr "Giliran %d daripada %d"

#: scripts/main.gd
msgid "Close replay"
msgstr "Tutup main semula"

#: scripts/main.gd
msgid "Turn %d / %d"
msgstr "Giliran %d / %d"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Saved on this PC between sessions"
msgstr "Disimpan pada PC ini antara sesi"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Move the table..."
msgstr "Alihkan meja..."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Back to the middle"
msgstr "Kembali ke tengah"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Your controllers"
msgstr "Pengawal anda"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show button labels"
msgstr "Tunjukkan label butang"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Floating labels beside each controller saying what its buttons do right now."
msgstr "Label terapung di sebelah setiap pengawal yang menerangkan fungsi butangnya sekarang."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The right trigger clicks when you let go of it, so holding it to zoom doesn't click anything."
msgstr "Picu kanan mengklik apabila anda melepaskannya, jadi menahannya untuk zum tidak mengklik apa-apa."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Look"
msgstr "Rupa"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Gameplay"
msgstr "Permainan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automation"
msgstr "Automasi"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Bunyi"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Panel"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kawalan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Game and saves"
msgstr "Permainan dan simpanan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "About"
msgstr "Perihal"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Around the table"
msgstr "Di sekeliling meja"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Backgrounds and tables are folders anyone can add: see backgrounds/README.md and tables/README.md."
msgstr "Latar belakang dan meja ialah folder yang boleh ditambah oleh sesiapa: lihat backgrounds/README.md dan tables/README.md."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Latar belakang"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The world around the table: sky, light and scenery."
msgstr "Dunia di sekeliling meja: langit, cahaya dan pemandangan."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Meja"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "What the map lies on. In VR its column stretches to the height you set."
msgstr "Tempat peta diletakkan. Dalam VR, tiangnya memanjang hingga ketinggian yang anda tetapkan."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Where the table stands"
msgstr "Tempat meja berdiri"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Alihkan meja ke mana-mana dalam pemandangan latar belakang - berguna untuk yang besar seperti peta yang ditukar. Diingati untuk latar belakang ini."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Alihkan meja ke mana-mana dalam pemandangan latar belakang - berguna untuk yang besar seperti peta yang ditukar. Meja telah dialihkan ke sini; Kembali ke tengah meletakkannya semula di tempat permulaan latar belakang."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Diingati untuk latar belakang ini."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Meja telah dialihkan ke sini; Kembali ke tengah meletakkannya semula di tempat permulaan latar belakang."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The map"
msgstr "Peta"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Tiles"
msgstr "Jubin"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "How terrain, wonders, resources and improvements look. Tilesets work like Unciv's: see tilesets/README.md."
msgstr "Rupa rupa bumi, keajaiban, sumber dan penambahbaikan. Tileset berfungsi seperti dalam Unciv: lihat tilesets/README.md."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Plain coloured hexes"
msgstr "Heksagon berwarna biasa"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Flat hexes in Unciv's terrain colours, no models."
msgstr "Heksagon rata dalam warna rupa bumi Unciv, tanpa model."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Unit"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Same as the tiles"
msgstr "Sama seperti jubin"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The unit models that come with the tileset above (the tiles' fallback set fills any gaps)."
msgstr "Model unit yang disertakan dengan tileset di atas (set sandaran jubin mengisi sebarang kekurangan)."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "No models"
msgstr "Tiada model"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Round tokens with Unciv's unit icons."
msgstr "Token bulat dengan ikon unit Unciv."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "How units look (Unciv's Unitset): any tileset with unit models (pieces/Units) can supply them."
msgstr "Rupa unit (Unitset Unciv): mana-mana tileset yang mempunyai model unit (pieces/Units) boleh membekalkannya."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Visual hints"
msgstr "Petunjuk visual"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Unciv's map overlays; the round buttons beside the overview turn them on and off too."
msgstr "Lapisan peta Unciv; butang bulat di sebelah gambaran keseluruhan juga menghidupkan dan mematikannya."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show unit movement arrows"
msgstr "Tunjukkan anak panah pergerakan unit"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Where units have just moved and who attacked whom."
msgstr "Tempat unit baru sahaja bergerak dan siapa menyerang siapa."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show tile yields"
msgstr "Tunjuk hasil jubin"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Food, production, gold... on every tile."
msgstr "Makanan, pengeluaran, emas... pada setiap jubin."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show worked tiles"
msgstr "Tunjuk jubin yang berfungsi"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Which tiles your cities' citizens work."
msgstr "Jubin yang diusahakan oleh rakyat bandar anda."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show resources and improvements"
msgstr "Tunjuk sumber dan peningkatan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Resource and improvement symbols on the tiles."
msgstr "Simbol sumber dan penambahbaikan pada jubin."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show improvement pictures"
msgstr "Tunjukkan gambar penambahbaikan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Farms, mines, roads and the like as models."
msgstr "Ladang, lombong, jalan dan sebagainya sebagai model."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show unit icons"
msgstr "Tunjukkan ikon unit"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The small Unciv icon above each unit model."
msgstr "Ikon kecil Unciv di atas setiap model unit."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Unciv's own translations, by Unciv's translators: the game's messages, names and descriptions. Our own menus are still in English."
msgstr "Terjemahan Unciv sendiri, oleh penterjemah Unciv: mesej, nama dan penerangan permainan. Menu kami sendiri masih dalam bahasa Inggeris."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Text Unciv has no translation for stays in English."
msgstr "Teks yang tiada terjemahan dalam Unciv kekal dalam bahasa Inggeris."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Turns"
msgstr "Giliran"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Check for idle units"
msgstr "Semak unit yang terbiar"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "End turn first takes you to every unit that still has no orders."
msgstr "Tamat giliran membawa anda dahulu ke setiap unit yang belum menerima arahan."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Auto unit cycle"
msgstr "Kitaran unit automatik"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "After you give a unit its orders, the next unit waiting for orders is selected."
msgstr "Selepas anda memberi arahan kepada unit, unit seterusnya yang menunggu arahan akan dipilih."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Cycle idle units by distance"
msgstr "Kitar unit terbiar mengikut jarak"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Next / previous unit go to the nearest unit rather than in a fixed order."
msgstr "Unit seterusnya / sebelumnya pergi ke unit terdekat dan bukan mengikut susunan tetap."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Ask for confirmation when ending the turn"
msgstr "Minta pengesahan semasa menamatkan giliran"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "End turn needs a second press."
msgstr "Tamat giliran perlu ditekan dua kali."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Order trade offers by amount"
msgstr "Pesan tawaran perdagangan mengikut jumlah"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "On the trade table, the biggest offers come first."
msgstr "Di meja perdagangan, tawaran terbesar didahulukan."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show suggested city locations"
msgstr "Tunjukkan lokasi bandar yang dicadangkan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "With a settler selected, Unciv's three best spots nearby for a new city are marked on the map."
msgstr "Apabila peneroka dipilih, tiga tempat terbaik Unciv berdekatan untuk bandar baharu ditanda pada peta."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "Tutorial"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show tutorials"
msgstr "Tunjuk tutorial"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The tutorial messages and the task card. Every tutorial is in the Civilopedia too."
msgstr "Mesej tutorial dan kad tugasan. Setiap tutorial juga ada dalam Civilopedia."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Reset tutorials"
msgstr "Tetapkan semila tutorial"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show every tutorial and task again, as if you were new."
msgstr "Tunjukkan semula setiap tutorial dan tugasan, seolah-olah anda baru bermula."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Other players"
msgstr "Pemain lain"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Other players' turns"
msgstr "Giliran pemain lain"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "What you see of the other players' turns after you end yours."
msgstr "Apa yang anda lihat daripada giliran pemain lain selepas anda menamatkan giliran anda."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show the moves and battles I can see"
msgstr "Tunjukkan pergerakan dan pertempuran yang dapat saya lihat"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Played back in order; the view glides to fights."
msgstr "Dimainkan semula mengikut urutan; pandangan meluncur ke arah pertempuran."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Show them, fast"
msgstr "Tunjukkan, dengan pantas"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The same, at two and a half times the speed."
msgstr "Sama, pada kelajuan dua setengah kali ganda."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Don't show them"
msgstr "Jangan tunjukkan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The map just updates."
msgstr "Peta hanya dikemas kini."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Unciv's own options for automated units and cities."
msgstr "Pilihan Unciv sendiri untuk unit dan bandar automatik."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated and exploring units move"
msgstr "Unit automatik dan yang meneroka bergerak"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "When units on automation, exploring or on multi-turn moves take their steps."
msgstr "Bila unit yang diautomatikkan, sedang meneroka atau dalam perjalanan berbilang giliran mengambil langkah mereka."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "When I end my turn"
msgstr "Apabila saya menamatkan giliran"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Explorers, automated workers and units on long moves go as you end the turn."
msgstr "Peneroka, pekerja automatik dan unit dalam perjalanan jauh bergerak semasa anda menamatkan giliran."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "At the start of my turn"
msgstr "Pada permulaan giliran saya"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "They go as your turn starts (Unciv's \"Automated units move on turn start\")."
msgstr "Mereka bergerak apabila giliran anda bermula (\"Automated units move on turn start\" dalam Unciv)."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Auto-assign city production"
msgstr "Tugaskan pengeluaran bandar secara automatik"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "A city that finishes building something picks what to build next itself."
msgstr "Bandar yang selesai membina sesuatu memilih sendiri apa yang hendak dibina seterusnya."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Auto-build roads"
msgstr "Bina jalan secara automatik"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated workers build roads between your cities."
msgstr "Pekerja automatik membina jalan antara bandar anda."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated workers replace improvements"
msgstr "Pekerja automatik gantikan peningkatan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated workers may swap an improvement for a better one."
msgstr "Pekerja automatik boleh menukar sesuatu penambahbaikan kepada yang lebih baik."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Stop automated workers from removing vegetation"
msgstr "Halang pekerja automatik daripada membuang tumbuhan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated workers leave forests, jungles and marshes alone."
msgstr "Pekerja automatik tidak mengusik hutan, rimba dan paya."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated units can upgrade"
msgstr "Unit automatik boleh dinaik taraf"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated military units upgrade themselves when you can afford it."
msgstr "Unit tentera automatik menaik taraf diri apabila anda mampu."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated units choose promotions"
msgstr "Unit automatik memilih kenaikan pangkat"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Automated units pick their own promotions."
msgstr "Unit automatik memilih kenaikan pangkat sendiri."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Cities auto-bombard at end of turn"
msgstr "Bandar mengebom secara automatik pada akhir giliran"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Cities that can still fire shoot at enemies in range when you end the turn."
msgstr "Bandar yang masih boleh menembak akan menembak musuh dalam jarak apabila anda menamatkan giliran."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Auto-assign specialists in new cities"
msgstr "Tugaskan pakar secara automatik di bandar baharu"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "New cities put their citizens into specialist slots themselves."
msgstr "Bandar baharu meletakkan rakyatnya sendiri ke dalam slot pakar."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Sound effects"
msgstr "Kesan bunyi"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Buttons, moves, battles and the rest. In VR they come from where they happen on the table."
msgstr "Butang, pergerakan, pertempuran dan lain-lain. Dalam VR, bunyi datang dari tempat ia berlaku di atas meja."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "City ambience"
msgstr "Suasana bandar"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The city noise that loops while you are in a city - Unciv has one for every era."
msgstr "Bunyi bandar yang berulang semasa anda berada di dalam bandar - Unciv mempunyai satu untuk setiap era."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Your own and mods'"
msgstr "Milik anda dan mod"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "None yet."
msgstr "Belum ada."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Put the panels back"
msgstr "Letakkan semula panel"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Every panel goes back to where its panel.json puts it."
msgstr "Setiap panel kembali ke tempat yang ditetapkan oleh panel.json-nya."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "In VR you see the controllers you're holding, as your headset's runtime draws them (SteamVR does; others get a plain stand-in)."
msgstr "Dalam VR, anda melihat pengawal yang anda pegang, seperti yang dilukis oleh runtime set kepala anda (SteamVR melakukannya; yang lain mendapat pengganti ringkas)."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Papan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Put the boards back"
msgstr "Letakkan semula papan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "The overview, info board, big screen, city boards, empire overview and this board go back where they started."
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan, papan maklumat, skrin besar, papan bandar, gambaran keseluruhan empayar dan papan ini kembali ke tempat asal."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "This game"
msgstr "Permainan ini"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Save game"
msgstr "Simpan permainan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Saves it under a name you type, in the bridge's save folder."
msgstr "Menyimpannya dengan nama yang anda taip, dalam folder simpanan bridge."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Save..."
msgstr "Simpan..."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Main menu"
msgstr "Menu utama"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Back to the main menu; the game keeps running and Resume brings you back."
msgstr "Kembali ke menu utama; permainan terus berjalan dan Teruskan membawa anda kembali."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Saves"
msgstr "Simpanan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Autosave"
msgstr "Autosimpan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "How often the game saves itself as \"Autosave\" (Continue in the main menu loads it)."
msgstr "Kekerapan permainan menyimpan dirinya sebagai \"Autosave\" (Sambung dalam menu utama memuatkannya)."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Save folder"
msgstr "Folder simpanan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "A virtual-reality table for Unciv, the open-source remake of Civilization V."
msgstr "Meja realiti maya untuk Unciv, pembuatan semula sumber terbuka Civilization V."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Bridge protocol"
msgstr "Protokol bridge"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Mods"
msgstr "Mod"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Your own tilesets, backgrounds and tables"
msgstr "Tileset, latar belakang dan meja anda sendiri"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Put their folders here; they show up in Look."
msgstr "Letakkan folder mereka di sini; ia akan muncul dalam Rupa."

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Settings file"
msgstr "Fail tetapan"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Licence and credits"
msgstr "Lesen dan kredit"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Desktop"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "On"
msgstr "Hidup"

