#: action_menu:407
msgid "City view  -  tiles, citizens, queue, buying"
msgstr "Paparan bandar  -  jubin, rakyat, baris gilir, pembelian"

#: action_menu:419
msgid "This city is being razed - it shrinks each turn until it's gone. Stop razing it in the city view."
msgstr "Bandar ini sedang dimusnahkan - ia mengecil setiap giliran sehingga lenyap. Hentikan pemusnahannya dalam paparan bandar."

#: action_menu:423
msgid "Producing"
msgstr "Mengeluarkan"

#: action_menu:423
msgid "Producing nothing - pick something below"
msgstr "Tiada apa dikeluarkan - pilih sesuatu di bawah"

#: action_menu:445,city_boards:412,city_boards:552,civilopedia_board:528
